{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>曾以電影《千刀萬里追》拿下金馬男配角獎的武打男星白鷹（原名王景春，本名白英），驚傳於5月27日逝世，享壽84歲。</p><p>香港資深媒體人汪曼玲於Facebook上證實噩耗，悲傷的表示：「白鷹大哥，一路走好。」</p><figure><img alt=\"武打男星白鷹（右）去世，香港資深媒體人汪曼玲（左）於FB上證實噩耗。（FB@汪曼玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143934514930651136846523.jpeg/DXQRTrInY9TncGfSZxOoQwWyToYTfGzST_tdOE_7XTg\"/><figcaption>武打男星白鷹（右）去世，香港資深媒體人汪曼玲（左）於FB上證實噩耗。（FB@汪曼玲）</figcaption></figure><p>白鷹主演功夫電影，在《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽出名：</p><figure><img alt=\"石雋（左起）、徐楓與白鷹都是胡金銓導演的固定班底。（FB@汪曼玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143936919261024256019632.jpeg/LhoMtiKLUnCkzo2iemMv7C26DyGSts6tqpOFZqqThWY\"/><figcaption>石雋（左起）、徐楓與白鷹都是胡金銓導演的固定班底。（FB@汪曼玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143936921307975680641750.jpeg/Nixc_18JLeGHKR5A_waNNoC2Z9-NjQkrW_H36lvx9-o\"/><figcaption>白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937711078510592879435.jpeg/2yfs8u284Sk-HVStXZnanVj8fJ-kuKZk_jRrc_40a3M\"/><figcaption>白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937708394024960136028.jpeg/gu86u_KlV1nmNEo4TUn68EA24ht5904gQvuFQ0L7hUM\"/><figcaption>白鷹在名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。（《龍門客棧》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（《俠女》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937713150627840702361.jpeg/wFxh6Iz1bCohp0lFGls_MTU0kLHm2Yykd-Fa4nfhWuI\"/><figcaption>白鷹（《俠女》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（《行規》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937715507957760173625.jpeg/uzKWIJkIqpM8LHfBSjbeHbKeIJbr_Z7olO8TjpTvE44\"/><figcaption>白鷹（《行規》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（《行規》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937717613629440937615.jpeg/8jEudaKMjmX21KaOucViT4WC3kySQ-9bfweNVX8HjVU\"/><figcaption>白鷹（《行規》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937707563552768048237.jpeg/_1Ii5fNjZ9PVB11H4x9y_JU0gJmbFX10V0HzrldB864\"/><figcaption>白鷹（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143937709782470656896543.jpeg/Pw3n1PR3OMI7553QS3SdqkE7AN2peH677x7kDO8e5Aw\"/><figcaption>白鷹（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白鷹（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260617/1143936917016940544381695.jpeg/RsYXQLUsY2MrZPAe1M9zxFNJ1hrkM9Kb8c8SHvHPEh4\"/><figcaption>白鷹（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>白鷹於70年代和80年代參與拍攝了多種類型的電影，以功夫電影為主，最知名的就是他在1967年的出道作，由名導胡金銓執導的電影《龍門客棧》，在片中飾演大太監曹少欽一角。</p><p>而白鷹與石雋、徐楓都是胡金銓導演的固定班底，合作了許多風格別樹一幟的武俠片。如今白鷹與世長辭，他在電影中帥氣的身影，也將永遠留在影迷心中。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336029630464013287.jpeg/L_cR-vx2hIfwTWvLfNOY8Qur0jIl_WQDKr84Yyq_OGM\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"知名男歌手黃大煒6月14日傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，享壽61歲。（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845332149768192253719.jpeg/U0gwk3aE7Wa5zbus52KC30F6Pv2OmtZmqZA05KmQNOQ\"/><figcaption>知名男歌手黃大煒6月14日傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，享壽61歲。（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845333546471424240591.jpeg/o7G1ELv_2yte2AU2IzGXdImX5HeKh2i0-VbuPPlW7jw\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142849454051692544760258.jpeg/7Ti8oi8ePFAXlBoOGDJCdCGFN9ay1FQIcjh1kHI4dZA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338537955328320561.jpeg/my07dCNbQ_iaBmD3M6ZrqasmPrfclpTUkNtWF5DbVhc\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845341159526400095463.jpeg/mOorlPMSqNbt4ny1IzyRFWZ313rRE673IEku0CBJLtA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343567187968764831.jpeg/MPF8EbetLLMD-K-KNYDihMLlzmXgJKFA_kAbBP5AGwQ\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336113516544825091.jpeg/gWMkFzkWAHbINv4tycQcoiZyIvDT3kN9v5rKzr-ays4\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338340823040386751.jpeg/eBV-OZS61osHFGIJliOPl83-Oj6TXzQEE8lJ2xPJSds\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845340685570048465273.jpeg/GIQxI6lBE-Mg5Gub2AYoU4pcN2PcyQr6Pv9gmD7_YJg\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343059677184786531.jpeg/xL2OlpXzirwFuFXNLT4q2u_sPppqKnxXzNCh4MzQoeA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><p>33歲男星猝死！前女友曝震撼對話　生前疑遭潛規則「身體已透支」</p><p>傳奇男星驚傳逝世！享壽98歲　生前曾怒告電影巨頭違約遭高層恐嚇封殺</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>"